  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fflashh%253fr%253dhorrorland\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HORRORLAND_WITH_VERITY/MP_HORRORLAND_VERITY_Header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"627\"></strong></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Horrorland 並非適合所有類型玩家的整合包，它是專為渴望前所未有冒險、追求史詩級遊戲體驗的玩家所設計的。在這裡，你將與強大的生物和怪物戰鬥，它們總在你最意想不到的時候現身恐嚇你，當然，也能在幾秒內結束你的生命。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，它非常適合在萬聖節等特殊時段遊玩，但毫無疑問，你也可以在全年任何時間繼續享受這款整合包。因為我們不僅加入了恐怖模組，還融入了 RPG 模組、動物生態、沉浸式體驗以及更多內容，讓你能充分沉浸並樂在其中。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>全新版本已推出，支援 Verity！！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>⚠️ 需完成 Verity 設定</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本整合包已內含 Verity。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>遊玩前，您必須完成必要的設定。</strong>若未正確配置，該模組將無法正常運作。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>設定指南</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">提供設定教學影片：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📺 設定教學 &ndash; 請<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_i4O7pyMlks&feature=youtu.be\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>點擊此處查看指南</strong></span></a>，在遊玩前完成 Verity 的設定。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您也可以使用 Ollama 在本地完全執行 Verity：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🖥️ Ollama 設定 &ndash; 若您希望改用 Ollama，請<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=515I23cVBIM&feature=youtu.be\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>點擊此處查看指南</strong></span></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>準備好與好友一起在頂級伺服器上遊玩了嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fflashh%253fr%253dhorrorland\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HORRORLAND_WITH_VERITY/MP_HORRORLAND_VERITY_Promo.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"253\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我強烈推薦使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fflashh%253fr%253dhorrorland\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a> 與好友一同遊玩，他們的伺服器品質卓越且無延遲。您可以無誤安裝任何 CurseForge 整合包或自訂模組。此外，他們的客服團隊全天候 24/7 待命，隨時協助解決問題。使用我的優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fflashh%253fr%253dhorrorland\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>可享購買 25% 折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HORRORLAND/BH_HORRORLAND_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1691\" height=\"168\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在這款整合包中生存將是一項複雜的挑戰，但絕非不可能。此外，真正困難的是熬過一整晚而不受驚嚇……保證讓你心跳加速！我們加入了大量模組與生物，它們的唯一目的就是在您遊玩時嚇唬您。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">至於神話恐怖模組，當然也加入了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cave-dweller-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Cave Dweller Reimagined</strong></span></a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endofherobrine\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The End of Herobrine</strong></span></a>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">但這還不是全部，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-hordes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Hordes</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-knocker\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Knocker</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-midnight-lurker\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Midnight Lurker</strong></span></a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/theundead\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Undead Revamped</strong></span></a> 等模組也同樣不可或缺。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">其他在本整合包中不可或缺的趣味主題模組，包含 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corail-tombstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Corail Tombstone</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-graveyard-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Graveyard</strong></span></a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eyes-in-the-darkness\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Eyes in the Darkness</strong></span></a>，保證會嚇您一跳哈哈哈！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我們加入了許多敵對生物模組，但特別想推薦社群中最受歡迎的幾個，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Bosses of Mass Destruction</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ice and Fire: Dragons</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>L_Ender's Cataclysm</strong></span></a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Mutant Monsters</strong></span></a>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生態區模組也絕對不能少，因此我們加入了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Biomes O' Plenty</strong></span></a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Regions Unexplored</strong></span></a>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">活體生物至關重要，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Alex's Mobs</strong></span></a> 在此整合包中也絕對不能缺席。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">別忘了，這款整合包非常適合 <strong>多人聯機</strong> 遊玩！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">任務系統由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/jalnyr256/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>jalnyr256</strong></span></a> 精心設計。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HORRORLAND/BH_HORRORLAND_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1691\" height=\"167\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/780/2024-10-26_12.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/781/2024-10-26_12.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/782/2024-10-26_12.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/783/2024-10-26_12.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/784/2024-10-26_12.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/785/2024-10-26_12.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/786/2024-10-26_13.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2347\" height=\"1467\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0ZLhLSn8y5M\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X4BEeSByGU\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HORRORLAND/BH_HORRORLAND_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2347\" height=\"232\"></a></strong></p>",
